  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\n<!-- Describe here the feature you are requesting. -->\r\n\r\nIs it possible or how could I implement the ability for users in a room to only be able to send or receive custom event types based on their powerlevel within the room? Like if I wanted only users with power levels over 10 to be able to read certain types of events. \r\n\r\nThat would mean that users with a power level of only 5 or whatever wouldn't even be able to receive those special events from the room.",
